WEBVTT

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:16.490
It's pointless to go!

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.170
In your current state, 
you can't defeat Ghost.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:35.810
Unless you overcome your limits.

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:37.540
My limits?

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:41.550
That's the only way to defeat him.

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:50.670
How dare you show up and act so superior!

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.270
What do you mean?

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:53.690
Come with me.

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:57.000
Instead of telling you, it's 
quicker if you experience it.

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:01.840
I'll teach you a new strategy 
that you know nothing about.

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:04.770
A new strategy...

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:28.050
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:33.580
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:38.060
Don't look back and keep going

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:43.890
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:48.870
There's no need to fear

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:56.540
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:02.550
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:08.320
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:13.720
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:21.830
And will lead you to a bright place

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:54.170
Further Evolution!Accel Synchro

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:08.680
Is there really a new strategy 
to defeat Meklord Emperor Wisel?

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:12.770
Meklord Emperor Wisel's effect activates!

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:20.040
Once a turn, Wisel can absorb a 
Synchro Monster on your field!

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:36.940
We're letting him leave?

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:39.630
It might be a trap to draw out Yusei!

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:41.040
Maybe so.

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:42.450
Then why?

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:45.640
Yusei sensed something within him.

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:50.040
Something that unites them 
because they're both D-Wheelers.

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:53.150
Because they're both D-Wheelers?

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:57.780
Due to these few turns, we 
now understand each other.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:03.380
The speed and wind inform me about 
the rumblings in Yusei's heart.

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:05.550
And my heart too.

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:11.530
That's something only Riding 
Duelists can understand!

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:15.500
It'll be fine, Aki!

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.770
You don't need to worry about Yusei!

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.500
Yeah...

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:26.830
They're going to duel!

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:32.020
I'll watch closely to see how 
your dueling can defeat Ghost.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:36.270
Let's start with a test.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:43.390
What do you mean?

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:45.860
He's not going to duel?

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.830
He wants me to follow.

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:58.880
Fine, here I go!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.860
What's he thinking?  He's not going to duel?

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:27.070
He drove through the turn 
perfectly at high speed.

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:29.120
He's an expert D-Wheeler.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:34.310
What?

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:37.780
It's like they're communicating 
while driving.

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:50.130
He drove through that curb at high speed!

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.130
If you're challenging me, I accept!

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:09.610
Yusei!

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:17.520
What's wrong, Yusei?

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:21.490
If this slow speed is scaring 
you, you'll never defeat him!

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:31.150
High speed consecutive turns!

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:36.310
Yusei!

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:50.820
He did it!

00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:52.590
That's the spirit!

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:56.590
As promised, I'll show you a dueling 
technique that'll defeat Ghost!

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:59.800
Speed World 2 set!

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:02.690
Duel Mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:09.370
A duel is about to begin.

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:12.700
Normal vehicles must leave 
the route immediately.

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:15.120
Lane selection...

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:17.520
Searching for optimal lane...

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:20.000
Sending duel lane request to Central.

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:22.360
Authorization!

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:27.400
Riding Duel!  Acceleration!

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:30.860
It's time to duel!

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:31.560
It's starting!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:36.650
Bring it, Yusei!

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:38.970
Show no mercy!  Attack me!

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:40.440
My turn!

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:43.700
I summon Tricular from my 
hand in defense position.

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:49.900
I set one card and end my turn.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:52.420
He wants to see what I do first.

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:54.080
My turn!

00:07:55.550 --> 00:08:02.460
I can Special Summon this card from my 
hand when monsters are only on your field.

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:06.680
I Special Summon the Tuner 
Monster Tech Genus Striker!

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.750
Tech Genus Striker?

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:14.970
I've never seen that monster before.

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:19.200
He already summoned a Tuner Monster.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:21.150
He must be planning to Synchro Summon.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:26.130
Oh, a duel.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:32.990
I remember him.

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:35.380
Go, Majestic Star Dragon!

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:39.410
Attack Wisel Top!  Shooting Blaster Sonic!

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:45.360
Yusei Fudo.

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:54.360
When I Special Summon a Level 
4-or-below monster to my field,

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:58.260
I can Special Summon this 
monster from my hand.

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:01.420
I Special Summon Tech Genus Warwolf.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:09.280
Level 2 Tech Genus Striker tunes 
Level 3 Tech Genus Warwolf!

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:13.150
Synchro Summon!

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:16.770
Appear, Tech Genus Power Gladiator!

00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:18.470
A Synchro Monster!

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:20.730
That's his Synchro Monster.

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:24.230
It doesn't seem to have any unique effects.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:29.740
Next, I Normal Summon the Tuner 
Monster Tech Genus Cyber Magician.

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:35.090
Is he planning to Synchro 
Summon twice in one turn?

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:47.830
When I use this card to Synchro Summon, I 
can get the required monsters from my hand.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:50.800
Synchro Summon using monsters from his hand?

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:57.310
Level 1 Tech Genus Cyber Magician tunes 
Level 4 Tech Genus Rush Rhino that's in my hand!

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:00.240
Synchro Summon!

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:04.010
Appear, Tech Genus Wonder Magician!

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:09.450
Two Synchro Monsters!

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:11.660
Will Yusei be okay?

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:15.280
He'll be fine!  Yusei won't lose against him!

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:16.700
Here I go, Yusei!

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:20.460
Tech Genus Power Gladiator attacks Tricular!

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:22.740
You take piercing damage!

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:28.940
Yusei!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.480
What's wrong, Yusei?  You're wobbling!

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:41.850
When Tricular is destroyed in battle, I 
can Special Summon Bicular from my deck!

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:47.130
Tech Genus Wonder Magician attacks Bicular!

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:48.740
Machiner's Sorcery!

00:10:50.610 --> 00:10:56.300
When Bicular is destroyed in battle, I can 
Special Summon Unicycular from my deck!

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:00.240
I end my turn.

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:02.710
All right!  He has a monster left!

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.420
It's the same as before.

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:07.640
I activate Turbo Synchron's effect!

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:10.610
The attack target switches 
to defense position!

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:14.550
But what can you do with Turbo Synchron?  
It only has 100 attack points!

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:23.630
He only has 100 life points left.

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:26.910
Yusei, do you realize what you've done?

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:30.720
Yusei...

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:37.830
They're also enjoying this duel.

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:43.690
Consecutive attacks by 
two Synchro Monsters...

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:47.850
Is this the new battle technique 
to defeat Meklord Emperor Wisel?

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:52.360
Stardust Dragon?

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:58.460
Once a turn, Wisel can absorb a 
Synchro Monster on your field!

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:06.540
Meklord Emperor Wisel can only absorb 
one Synchro Monster per turn.

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:11.740
If there are two Synchro Monsters, even 
if one is absorbed, the other remains.

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:14.940
Is this really the answer?

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:17.210
Or is it something else?

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:21.220
Yusei, in your current state, 
you can't defeat Ghost.

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:24.790
Unless you overcome your limits.

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:30.360
What's wrong, Yusei?  It's your turn.

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:32.540
My turn!

00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:34.800
Synchro Defuse.

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:36.680
If I use this effect...

00:12:36.990 --> 00:12:39.900
I activate Speed Spell - Synchro Defuse!

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:43.940
When I have 2 or more Speed 
Counters, I gain control

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:47.680
of one Synchro Monster on your 
field until the End Phase!

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:50.600
Control a Synchro Monster?

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:55.250
I get it!  He can use that effect 
to recreate the same situation

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:59.350
when Ghost absorbed his Synchro Monster!

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:08.300
I gain control of Power Gladiator!

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:10.970
He did it!

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:18.210
What's he planning to do?

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:19.540
Watch, Yusei!

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:22.960
This is the new battle 
technique to defeat Ghost!

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:24.180
Accel Synchro!

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:25.650
Accel Synchro?

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:45.940
Watch, Yusei!

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:49.300
This is the new battle 
technique to defeat Ghost!

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:50.570
Accel Synchro!

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:52.040
Accel Synchro?

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:13.950
He vanished.

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:31.160
What happened?

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:33.020
What's that monster?

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:37.690
It's the Accel Synchro Monster 
Tech Genus Blade Blaster!

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:39.690
Accel Synchro Monster?

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:44.560
You Synchro Summoned a Synchro 
Monster during my turn?

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:49.950
It's a Synchro Summon that uses a Synchro 
Tuner Monster and a Synchro Monster.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.270
It's an Accel Synchro Summon!

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:57.270
It's another Synchro Summon 
after a Synchro Summon.

00:14:57.590 --> 00:14:58.950
Accel Synchro!

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:08.300
This is what he meant when he said 
that I had to overcome my limits.

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:12.080
Bring it, Yusei!  Try to defeat me!

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:15.850
Blade Blaster has 3300 attack points.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:16.800
In that case...

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:20.140
I activate Speed Spell - Angel Baton!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:22.930
When I have 2 or more Speed Counters...

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:27.370
I draw two cards from my deck and send 
one card in my hand to the graveyard!

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:30.840
I summon the Tuner Monster Drill Synchron!

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:38.550
When there's a Tuner on my field, I can 
Special Summon Quillbolt Hedgehog from my graveyard!

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:46.760
Level 3 Drill Synchron tunes Level 1 
Unicycular and Level 2 Quillbolt Hedgehog!

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:51.460
The powers come together to form 
a spear that pierces the land!

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:53.360
Become the path that lights the way!

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:54.400
Synchro Summon!

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:56.740
Pulverize, Drill Warrior!

00:15:58.520 --> 00:16:04.340
Drill Warrior can halve its attack 
points to attack you directly!

00:16:06.010 --> 00:16:08.550
Pierce through!  Drill Shoot!

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.660
I set one card and end my turn.

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:23.130
That's good, Yusei!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.130
Don't be scared to attack me!

00:16:25.530 --> 00:16:28.150
Fear diminishes your potential.

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:32.600
That's how darkness creeps up on you!

00:16:34.070 --> 00:16:35.540
My turn!

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:41.580
Tech Genus Blade Blaster 
attacks Drill Warrior!

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:43.380
Shoot Blade!

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:47.520
I activate my trap Wave Force!

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:51.070
When a Synchro Monster is the attack target,

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:54.870
all monsters on your field in 
attack position are destroyed!

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:58.140
Now that monster will be destroyed!

00:16:58.610 --> 00:17:02.110
When a trap affects Tech Genus Blade Blaster,

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:05.860
I can send one card in my hand 
to the graveyard to negate it!

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:16.750
I activate the trap Miracle's Wake!

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:21.940
I Special Summon a monster that 
was destroyed in battle this turn!

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:24.610
Resurrect, Drill Warrior!

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:30.000
I end my turn!

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:34.300
The monitor is working again.

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.900
What's that monster?

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:39.100
Yusei is down to 1100 life points!

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:45.700
What happened while the screen was offline?

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:51.180
I managed to save Drill Warrior.

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:55.680
But Blade Blaster has 3300 attack points.

00:17:56.230 --> 00:18:00.020
Drill Warrior only has 2400 attack 
points, so it can't do anything.

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:06.230
I have Speed Energy and Shining 
Silver Force in my hand.

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:10.230
With Speed Energy, when I have 
2 or more Speed Counters...

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:13.110
...a monster on my field gains attack points

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:16.240
equal to the number of Speed 
Counters multiplied by 200.

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:22.900
I'll have 4 Speed Counters next turn, so 
I can increase its attack points by 800.

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:27.250
But Drill Warrior will only 
have 3200 attack points.

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:31.150
I still can't defeat Blade Blaster 
because it has 3300 attack points.

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:33.150
What's wrong, Yusei?

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:34.690
Are you giving up?

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:41.160
My cards, answer my voice!

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:44.400
My turn!

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:52.520
I activate Speed Spell - Speed Energy!

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:56.860
Drill Warrior gains attack points equal to 
the number of Speed Counters multiplied by 200!

00:18:59.380 --> 00:19:01.960
Next, I summon Gauntlet Warrior!

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:12.410
By releasing this card, Warrior-Type 
monsters on my field gain 500 attack points!

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:15.270
I release Gauntlet Warrior!

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:23.300
Drill Warrior's attack 
points increase to 3700!

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:31.250
Drill Warrior attacks 
Tech Genus Blade Blaster!

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:34.220
Pulverize!  Drill Lancer!

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:36.190
He did it!

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:38.390
I activate my monster effect!

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:43.320
Once per opponent's turn, Tech Genus 
Blade Blaster can be removed from play!

00:19:43.930 --> 00:19:45.050
What?

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:55.240
He sacrificed his life points 
to protect his monster!

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:15.990
That was an impressive attack.

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:21.620
Why did you protect your monster?

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:25.700
If you didn't do that, this 
duel wouldn't be over!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:32.810
I'm not willing to reveal all 
my Accel Synchro secrets.

00:20:33.010 --> 00:20:35.150
Why did you use Accel Synchro against me?

00:20:36.340 --> 00:20:41.620
I'm looking forward to the day 
when we can duel again, Yusei.

00:20:56.140 --> 00:20:59.470
There was no winner.  How lame.

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:01.670
It's not lame.

00:21:01.850 --> 00:21:05.910
With that duel, a new door opens.

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:15.320
Though still imperfect, humans of 
the past now have new potential.

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:19.320
What happened inside that light?

00:21:28.750 --> 00:21:30.000
Accel Synchro...

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:46.160
I promise to overcome my limits!

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:14.570
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:14.570 --> 00:22:19.580
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:24.480
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:29.490
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:29.690 --> 00:22:34.360
The cruel god tests us

00:22:34.660 --> 00:22:41.300
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:41.300 --> 00:22:45.170
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:45.170 --> 00:22:51.040
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:51.210 --> 00:22:54.970
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.970 --> 00:23:00.940
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:03.910
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:03.910 --> 00:23:06.140
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:06.140 --> 00:23:10.820
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:11.110 --> 00:23:13.680
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:13.680 --> 00:23:17.150
You want to party until the morning

00:23:17.150 --> 00:23:20.390
At our special place
